     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "1989 - together with Soviet forces, the East German army is advancing into the northern plains of West Germany."\
     "I British Corps is defending the approach to the Rhine as part of NORTHAG."\
     ""\
     "A motorized rifle platoon of the NVA has been tasked with securing a bridge in the vicinity of Koskelankyla, which is being defended by an understrength British light infantry platoon."
